---
source: crates/okbot-cli/tests/agent_history.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(out.stdout).unwrap()"
---
Read retained conversations and agent-run audit records

Usage: okbot history <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List conversations, newest activity first
  show    Show retained messages, including before the latest /reset (oldest first within the page)
  search  Find literal substrings with Unicode lowercase matching, newest matches first
  runs    Read the existing agent-turn audit, newest first; unknown model/usage stay null
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
